      <h1 class="banner-title">
        Kepler Cheuvreux ranked 1st Country Broker in 2026      </h1>
      <div class="banner-introduction">
              </div>
    </div>
    <div class="post-content">
      
<p>Kepler Cheuvreux is proud to share its results in the 2026 Extel Survey for Europe.</p>



<p><strong>Once again, investor votes confirm Kepler Cheuvreux’s position as Europe&#8217;s leading independent equity broker and a trusted partner across Research, Corporate Access, Sales, and Trading &amp; Execution.</strong></p>



<p>Key highlights:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>#1 Best Country Broker</li>



<li>#1 Overall Country Research</li>



<li>#1 Country Corporate Access</li>



<li>#1 Country Sales</li>



<li>#2 Country Trading &amp; Execution</li>
</ul>



<p>Research excellence remains at the heart of our franchise:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>14 industry sectors ranked in the Top 10</li>



<li>21 analysts ranked in the Top 10 across country research categories</li>



<li>4 macro research categories ranked in the Top 10</li>
</ul>



<p>A sincere thank you to our clients, corporate partners and investors for their continued trust and support.</p>



<p>Congratulations to all our teams on this achievement.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
